rer" aria-label="U.S. government aerial photo. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">U.S. government aerial photo</a></span></div><figcaption>A street of homes in Del Webb North Myrtle Beach, with a pond and a walking path behind them.</figcaption></figure></div><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The homes are on short streets around ponds, with the clubhouse, pools and courts in the middle of the neighborhood.</p><div class="c3-aerial"><figure class="c3ph-hero" style=""><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-from-above-2026-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-from-above-2026-600w.webp 600w, /images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-from-above-2026-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1136px" width="1200" height="900" alt="Del Webb North Myrtle Beach from above in winter, with its edge drawn in orange: curving streets of homes around ponds, and the clubhouse with its pools and courts marked in the middle" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/USCODE-2023-title17/html/USCODE-2023-title17-chap1-sec105.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="U.S. government aerial photo. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">U.S. government aerial photo</a></span></div><figcaption>Del Webb North Myrtle Beach from above. The orange line is the edge of the neighborhood.</figcaption></figure></div><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">New homes come with:</p><ul style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin:0 0 1rem 1.3rem;padding:0"><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">Fabric hurricane covers for the windows</li><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">A warranty on the structure for 10 years, which a later owner keeps</li><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">Sprinklers in every yard</li></ul></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="what-is-there-to-do-in-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Things to do">What is there to do in Del Webb North Myrtle Beach?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The clubhouse in Del Webb North Myrtle Beach, also called the amenity center, has a gathering room, an arts and crafts room and a fitness center.</p><div class="c3-aerial c3-aerial-close"><figure class="c3ph-hero" style=""><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-clubhouse-from-above-2026-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-clubhouse-from-above-2026-600w.webp 600w, /images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-clubhouse-from-above-2026-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1136px" width="1200" height="900" alt="The Del Webb North Myrtle Beach clubhouse from above, labelled: a large gray-roofed building, an outdoor pool with a deck behind it, a row of green sports courts by the parking lot, and a pond and rows of homes around them" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/USCODE-2023-title17/html/USCODE-2023-title17-chap1-sec105.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="U.S. government aerial photo. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">U.S. government aerial photo</a></span></div><figcaption>The clubhouse, the outdoor pool and the courts, from above.</figcaption></figure></div><ul role="list" class="c3ph-cards c3ph-4" style="--c3ph-r:4/3"><li class="c3ph-card"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 240 180" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><re