ass="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 4H5l2.2 10.5h10.3L19.6 7H6"/><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="19" r="1.6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Groceries</strong><span class="t">About 3 minutes</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 10a9 7 0 0 1 18 0zM12 10v10M2 21c3-1.5 6-1.5 10 0s7 1.5 10 0"/></svg></span><span><strong>Beach</strong><span class="t">About 15 minutes</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M16 10h4a2 2 0 0 1 0 4h-4l-4 7H9l2-7H7l-2 2H3l2-4-2-4h2l2 2h4L9 3h3z"/></svg></span><span><strong>Airport</strong><span class="t">About 20 minutes</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 21, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Myrtle Trace is a 55+ neighborhood of mostly one-story houses just outside Conway, with a pool, ponds and a busy club calendar.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Myrtle Trace has about 500 homes, and at least one person in each home must be 55 or older. The homeowners association (HOA) fee is $95 a month.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Conway Medical Center and a Walmart Supercenter are each about 3 minutes away by car. Owners share a clubhouse, a pool and ponds for fishing. The neighborhood calendar lists about 70 events and club meetings a month.</p><div style="margin-top:1.4rem"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Talk to an agent</a></div><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:2rem;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#what-is-close-to-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What is close</a></li><li><a href="#what-is-a-month-like-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">A normal month</a></li><li><a href="#what-are-the-homes-like-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The homes</a></li><li><a href="#what-is-conway-like" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Conway</a></li><li><a href="#what-does-it-cost-to-live-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Costs</a></li><li><a href="#who-can-live-in-myrtle-trace" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--n