 <p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem;margin-top:1.2rem">Free-standing emergency rooms fill the gaps between them. Grand Strand Health runs one on the north strand, one in Carolina Forest on Oakheart Road, and South Strand Medical Center on the US-17 Bypass at Sheffield Parkway. Conway Medical Center broke ground in October 2025 on a free-standing emergency department in the Socastee area.</p></div></section>
 
