re><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Our <a href="/buyers/55-plus-communities/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">55+ communities guide</a> compares more of them.</p><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Homes near the golf, beach or clubhouse you want</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Tell us what you want near home, and we send you one-level houses for sale that fit, inside or outside a 55+ community.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Send us what you want nearby</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="hospitals"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Hospitals">How close are the hospitals to Myrtle Beach's 55+ communities?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each of the four is 3 to 10 minutes by car from a hospital, without traffic.</p><figure style="margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:760px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co" viewBox="0 0 360 361" width="360" height="361" role="img" aria-label="Hospitals near the 55+ communities: a map of 8 places, numbered 1, Myrtle Trace; 2, Seasons at Prince Creek West; 3, Del Webb at Grande Dunes; 4, Del Webb North Myrtle Beach; 5, Conway Medical Center; 6, Grand Strand Medical Center; 7, Tidelands Waccamaw Community Hospital; and 8, McLeod Health Seacoast." style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:760px;background:#f7f3ec;border:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.15)"><style>#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co text{font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#f7f3ec;stroke-width:3px;stroke-linejoin:round;fill:#1c202