-<div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/">Buyers</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Waterfront Homes</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Intracoastal, channel, creek, and oceanfront</p><h1 class="detail-h1">Waterfront homes in Myrtle Beach:<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">the dock decides the value.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge, 30+ years on the Grand Strand &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 27, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Oceanfront, Intracoastal Waterway, channel, creek and lake are five different purchases with five price tags. Docks, flood zones, insurance and boat access, checked before you offer.</p><div style="margin-top:1.8rem;display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="#lead-form">Set up a waterfront tour</a><a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call 854.333.2135</a></div></div></div><section style="background:var(--navy)" id="lead-form"><div class="wrap" style="padding:3rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:.8rem">Tour waterfront homes.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);margin:0 auto 1.6rem;line-height:1.7">Tell us the boat and the budget. We line up homes on the right water and check the dock, the depth, and the flood zone before you tour.</p></div><div id="ldWrap" style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--ivory);border-radius:14px;padding:1.6rem;text-align:left"><div class="idx-lead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><input class="idx-input" id="ldCtx" placeholder="What are you looking for? (boat size, area, budget)"></div><div class="idx-lead"><input class="idx-input" id="ldName" placeholder="Your name"><input class="idx-input" id="ldPhone" placeholder="Phone" type="tel"></div><div class="idx-lead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><input class="idx-input" id="ldEmail" placeholder="Email" type="email"></div><label style="display:flex;gap:.5rem;align-items:flex-start;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.72rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;margin:0 0 .85rem;cursor:pointer"><input type="checkbox" id="ldConsent" style="margin-top:.15rem;accent-color:var(--brass);flex-shrink:0;width:15px;height:15px"><span>I consent to receive calls and text messages from Chapter 3 Realty about my property inquiry, showing appointments, and listing information I requested, at the phone number provided, including calls placed using an automated system or an artificial or prerecorded voice. Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply. Reply HELP for help, STOP to opt out. Consent is not a condition of any purchase.</span></label><p id="ldErr" style="display:none;color:#a03333;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;margin:0 0 .7rem"></p><button class="btn btn-brass" style="width:100%" onclick="ldSubmit()">Set up a waterfront tour</button><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);margin:.7rem 0 0;line-height:1.5">Free, no obligation. We reach out the same day, evenings included. Prefer to talk now? <a href="tel:+18543332135" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding:.35rem .8rem;font-size:.8rem">Call 854.333.2135</a>.</p></div><div id="ldOk" style="display:none;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:rgba(244,239,232,.08);border:1px solid var(--brass);border-radius:14px;padding:1.4rem;color:var(--ivory);text-align:center;line-height:1.6">Thanks. A licensed agent will reach out the same day, evenings included, to set up your waterfront tour.</div><script>
