-<section style="background:var(--navy)"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;padding:3rem 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:.8rem">Run Myrtle Beach Airbnb numbers on a real address.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 1.6rem;line-height:1.7">We build the revenue, expense, and financing picture for specific properties, including the condotel buildings most lenders decline, because our preferred lender BrickWood Mortgage closes them at the same fees as any other loan.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:.75rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get an income analysis</a><a href="/invest/condotel-financing/" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--brass-2);text-decoration:none;align-self:center">Condotel financing →</a><a href="/invest/str-setup/" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--brass-2);text-decoration:none;align-self:center">Setup after closing →</a></div></div></section>
