small-multifamily/">Small multifamily</a><p class="nav-mega-h stacked">For sellers</p><a href="/sell/">Selling your home</a><a href="/sell/home-value/">What your home is worth</a><a href="/sell/net-proceeds/">Net proceeds calculator</a><a href="/sell/fsbo/">Selling it yourself (FSBO)</a><a href="/sell/out-of-state-buyers/">Out-of-state buyers</a><a href="/sell/inherited-house/">Inherited house</a><a href="/sell/sell-my-condo/">Sell a condo</a><a href="/sell/capital-gains/">Capital gains &amp; withholding</a></div><div class="nav-mega-col"><p class="nav-mega-h">Neighborhoods</p><a href="/homes/map/">Search homes</a><a href="/submarkets/myrtle-beach/">Myrtle Beach</a><a href="/submarkets/north-myrtle-beach/">North Myrtle Beach</a><a href="/submarkets/carolina-forest/">Carolina Forest</a><a href="/submarkets/surfside-beach/">Surfside Beach</a><a href="/submarkets/murrells-inlet/">Murrells Inlet</a><a href="/submarkets/pawleys-island/">Pawleys Island</a><a href="/submarkets/little-river/">Little River</a><a href="/submarkets/conway/">Conway</a><a href="/submarkets/garden-city/">Garden City</a><p class="nav-mega-h stacked">Company</p><a href="/market-reports/">Market reports</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></div></div><div class="nav-mega-foot"><a href="/guides/">View the full directory of guides, tools, and reports &#8594;</a></div></div></div><div class="nav-dd"><a href="/about/" class="nav-dd-trigger">About<span class="nav-caret">&#9662;</span></a><div class="nav-dd-menu"><a href="/why-chapter-3/">Why Us</a><a href="/about/">Meet the Team</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></div></div></nav>
