-<section style="background:var(--navy)"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;padding:3rem 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:.8rem">Check a Myrtle Beach condo building before you offer.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 1.6rem;line-height:1.7">We pull the association documents, the real fee, the rental program terms, and the financing path through BrickWood Mortgage before you write anything. The building matters more than the unit, so learn the building before you offer.</p><div style="display:flex;gap:.75rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Have us check a building</a><a href="/invest/condotel-financing/" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--brass-2);text-decoration:none;align-self:center">How condotel loans work →</a></div></div></section>
