cle><text x="616" y="75.68543840000002" font-size="11" font-weight="600" text-anchor="end" fill="#1c2028">July 2026: $342,010</text></svg></div><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The peak was March 2007 at $242,124. The low was November 2011 at $159,453, a fall of 34.1 percent over 56 months. The index did not pass the 2007 peak again until December 2020, 165 months later. A buyer at the top who sold before then sold below the purchase price, before any selling cost.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The fastest rise was July 2021 to July 2022, 26.7 percent in twelve months. The value has been flat since: May 2024 was the high at $352,722, and July 2026 is 3.0 percent below it.</p><div style="overflow-x:auto;margin:1.2rem 0;max-width:760px"><table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:.92rem"><thead><tr><th style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy);text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase">Bought in July</th><th style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy);text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase">Typical value then</th><th style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy);text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase">Change to July 2026</th><th style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);color:var(--navy);text-align:left;font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase">A year</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--muted)">2025 (1 year)</td><td style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--muted)">$341,411</td><td styl