5%</strong><span class="t">Airbnb, most hosts</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10.8 12.2 20 3M16.8 6.2l2.5 2.5M14.3 8.7l2 2"/><circle cx="7.5" cy="15.5" r="4.5"/></svg></span><span><strong>8 in 10</strong><span class="t">oceanfront condos for sale in a program</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 12, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">One Myrtle Beach resort's rental desk kept 38.6 percent of the rent. Airbnb takes 15.5 percent from most hosts.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">One oceanfront Myrtle Beach resort's rental desk kept 38.6 percent of the rent, before its other charges. Airbnb now takes 15.5 percent from most hosts, and Vrbo takes 12 percent.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Of each $1,000 guests paid, that desk left the owner $614. Airbnb leaves $845. Running it yourself keeps more while the cleaner, supplies and your time cost less than $231 of each $1,000.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A rental program is the building's own rental desk. It books the guests, cleans the unit and sends you the rest. We get the building's program agreement and owner statements and run it both ways before you offer.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Know what the rental desk keeps before you buy.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Have us run it both ways</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#what-it-takes" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What a program takes</a></li><li><a href="#which-keeps-more" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Program vs Airbnb</a></li><li><a href="#a-year" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">A year, both ways</a></li><li><a href="#buildings" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Buildings with programs</a></li><li><a href="#leaving" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Leaving the program</a></li><li><a href="#standards" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What it requires</a></li><li><a href="#own-use" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-d