5rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Rental returns FAQ</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="what-return-should-you-expect-on-a-myrtle-beach-rental"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3">What return should you expect on a Myrtle Beach rental?</h2><style>@media (min-width:700px){main#main .detail-h1{text-wrap:balance}}main#main .detail-h1 em{display:block;font-size:clamp(1.3rem,2.5vw,2.25rem);line-height:1.25;margin-top:.55rem;text-wrap:balance}@media (max-width:959px){main#main .detail-h1 em{color:#8a5226!important}}</style><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(210px,100%),1fr));gap:.85rem;margin:1.1rem 0 1.3rem;max-width:760px">
