y. We run the numbers before you offer.</p><div style="margin-top:1.4rem"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call to learn more</a></div><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:2rem;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#what-is-a-housing-choice-voucher" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What is a Housing Choice Voucher?</a></li><li><a href="#who-runs-the-program-in-horry-county" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Who runs the program in Horry County?</a></li><li><a href="#how-much-does-a-voucher-pay" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">How much does a voucher pay?</a></li><li><a href="#how-is-the-rent-split-between-the-tenant-and-the-authority" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">How is the rent split between the tenant and the authority?</a></li><li><a href="#what-stops-you-from-charging-the-most-the-voucher-allows" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What stops you from charging the most the voucher allows?</a></li><li><a href="#how-do-you-get-a-house-approved" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">How do you get a house approved?</a></li><li><a href="#how-hard-is-it-to-find-a-tenant-with-a-voucher" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-und