-<h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">What lenders check</h2>
-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:.4rem">Every lender differs a little, but most DSCR programs look at four things.</p>
