-<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/invest/">Invest</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Fix and Flip</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Strategy</p><h1 class="detail-h1">How do you find a fix and flip in Myrtle Beach?<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">What quick resales gained here last year, where they were, and how our deal finder looks for the next one.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 29, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Local numbers from the county's deeds, the 70 percent rule, and the rules a flip meets here.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Yes, a fix and flip can pay here if you buy right. In the year to September 2026, Horry County homes were resold within 12 months of their last sale at least 344 times. When a company resold the home, the middle gain between the two deed prices was about $75,000, before any costs. Conway, Carolina Forest and Little River had the biggest gains on houses.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Our deal finder pulls every house for sale with a reason to be cheap and compares it with what houses its size sold for nearby. An agent then reads the repairs and works out your highest offer.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">The best houses for sale this week, in your price range</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Get the flip list</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#local-numbers" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Local numbers</a></li><li><a href="#where" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Where</a></li><li><a href="#how-we-find-them" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">How we find them</a></li><li><a href="#the-math" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The math</a></li><li><a href="#local-costs" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Local costs</a></li><li><a href="#permits" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Permits and licenses</a></li><li><a href="#selling-it" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Selling it</a></li><li><a href="#selling" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-deco