-<h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Four units or fewer keeps the loan simple</h2>
-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">Lenders draw a hard line at four units. That line decides the kind of loan you can get and the cash you need.</p>
-<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(280px,100%),1fr));gap:1rem;margin:1.6rem 0;max-width:820px">
