-<ul style="list-style:none;display:grid;gap:.6rem;margin:0;padding:0">
-<li style="color:var(--navy);line-height:1.55">Counts as a commercial loan.</li>
-<li style="color:var(--navy);line-height:1.55">Bigger down payment.</li>
