+If the owners add a rental rule after you buy Where Who the new rule binds
+South Carolina, condos and HOAs Who the new rule binds Everyone, including owners who bought first.
+Florida, condos Who the new rule binds Only owners who consent to the amendment, and later buyers ( 718.110(13) ).
+Florida, HOAs Who the new rule binds For a rental rule adopted after July 1, 2021, only owners who agree and later buyers. A rule against leases under 6 months, or more than three a year, binds everyone ( 720.306(1)(h) ).
