+### Can an HOA ban rentals in South Carolina?
+Yes. A recorded rule that bans or limits renting is enforceable. State law requires the rule to be recorded with the county to count. It does not limit what a recorded rule may say about renting.
+
+### Do builders offer incentives to investors?
+Rarely. Most incentives go to buyers using the builder's preferred lender with an FHA, VA or conventional loan. In Chapter3's experience an investor loan almost never gets them.
