+A rental pays you two ways. The rent left after the cost of owning the house, and the appreciation when you sell.
+The three return tiles assume you paid cash. A loan changes the money you put in, and adds a payment the rent has to cover. That is the coverage ratio, and it is one of the four dealbreakers below.
