-### Cash-on-cash return
-The cash left after the loan payments in a year, divided by the cash you put in. If you pay cash, it is the same as the cap rate. A loan raises it or lowers it, and the calculator shows which once you type the payment.
-With no loan, aim for the same 6 percent.
