rgin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">List it, unless the house needs heavy repairs, cannot get a loan or insurance, or must be sold by a fixed date. Then a cash offer can be the better choice.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Companies that bought Horry County houses from their owners and resold them within a year paid about 68 cents for each dollar of the resale price. That is the middle sale: half paid more, half paid less. On a house worth $260,000 fixed up, that is an offer of about $178,000.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A cash sale skips the wait for a loan. In September 2026, the middle listed home in the Myrtle Beach area took 53 days to get a signed contract, then about five weeks to close.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Got a cash offer? Send it to us before you answer. We will set it beside what listing would leave you.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send us the offer you got</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#who-buys" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Who the cash buyers are</a></li><li><a href="#how-much-less" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">How much less</a></li><li><a href="#what-you-keep" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">What you keep</a></li><li><a href="#when-cash" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">When cash is better</a></li><li><a href="#as-is" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Selling as is</a></li><li><a href="#check" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Checking the buyer</a></li><li><a href="#cash-offer-faq" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Cash offer FAQ</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="who-buys"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Who the cash buyers are">Who makes cash offers on houses in Myrtle Beach?</h2><style>.c3ph-f{position:relative;margin:0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ivory-2)}.c3ph-f img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:cover}.c3ph-cr{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;max-width:100%;padding:1.6rem .6rem .35rem 2.6rem;font:400 .625rem/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.01em;color:#fff;text-align:right;background:radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 100%,rgba(28,32,40,.72),rgba(28,32,40,.4) 55%,rgba(28,32,40,0));white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;pointer-events:none}.c3ph-cr a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);text-underline-offset:2px;pointer-events:auto;padding:10px 0 6px}.c3ph-hero{margin:1.6rem 0 2rem}.c3ph-hero .c