-<div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/sell/">Sell</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">For Sale By Owner</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Selling without an agent in South Carolina</p><h1 class="detail-h1">For sale by owner<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">in Myrtle Beach.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge, 30+ years on the Grand Strand &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 8, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Selling by owner is legal in South Carolina. Do it with a licensed coach, keep the savings if it works, and pay nothing extra if you hire an agent later.</p><div style="margin-top:1.8rem;display:flex;gap:.75rem;flex-wrap:wrap"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="#lead-form">Ask about FSBO coaching</a><a class="btn btn-outline btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call 854.333.2135</a></div></div></div><section style="background:var(--navy)" id="lead-form"><div class="wrap" style="padding:3rem 1.5rem"><div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.9rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:.8rem">Sell it yourself, with a licensed team behind you.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.6);margin:0 auto 1.6rem;line-height:1.7">FSBO coaching for a flat fee: pricing, paperwork, and process. Hire us to list at any point and the full coaching fee is credited back.</p></div><div id="ldWrap" style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--ivory);border-radius:14px;padding:1.6rem;text-align:left"><div class="idx-lead" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><input class="idx-input" id="ldCtx" placeholder="Property address">