-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:.5rem">Custom CMA and Pricing Plan</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7">A CMA is a price estimate built from recent nearby sales. Ours is a full comparable-sales analysis using Coastal Carolinas Association of REALTORS data, active competition, expired listings, and your property's specific features. You get a pricing range with the reasoning behind it, not a single "list at this" number. We also complete the SC Residential Property Condition Disclosure together.</p>
