-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:.5rem">Pre-Listing Prep and Presentation</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7">We walk the property, in person or via video call, and give you a targeted prep list. We focus on items a home inspector will flag, cosmetic items with measurable return, and condition-of-systems items that affect appraisal. No over-improvement. Professional photography, drone, and twilight scheduled and coordinated by us.</p>
