-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:.5rem">Marketing Launch: The First 7 Days</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7">The first seven days are the highest-traffic window of any listing. MLS live, Zillow/Realtor.com syndication, targeted paid social to the Northeast and Midwest feeder markets, and direct outreach to our buyer database and active buyer agents. If you're not getting showings in 14 days, we have a conversation, not a silence.</p>
