-<div>
-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:.5rem">Showings, Feedback, and Repositioning</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.87rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7">Every showing generates written feedback delivered to you within 48 hours. We re-evaluate pricing and marketing weekly. You never go more than 7 days without a market update. If the data says reposition, we tell you, before you lose another 30 days chasing a price the market won't support.</p>
-</div>
