-<section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><div style="text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 2.2rem"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:.75rem">What Your Listing Gets</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:2.4rem;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:1rem">Four things other Myrtle Beach listings do not get</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75">These are specific to Chapter3. They exist to make buyers trust your house enough to write the offer.</p></div><div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(300px,100%),1fr));gap:1.2rem;max-width:940px;margin:0 auto"><div style="background:var(--ivory-2);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem 1.6rem"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--brass);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.5rem">01</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.55rem">An investor analysis, published</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:.93rem;margin:0">We run your house through the same pass-or-fail investment analysis we use for investors and share the numbers with buyers. Data makes buyers confident, and confident buyers make offers.</p></div><div style="background:var(--ivory-2);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem 1.6rem"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--brass);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.5rem">02</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.55rem">A flood-claim history check</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:.93rem;margin:0">A local insurance agent tells us whether FEMA claims have been filed on the home, and we can show buyers that history up front. On the coast, that peace of mind sells houses.</p></div><div style="background:var(--ivory-2);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem 1.6rem"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--brass);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.5rem">03</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.55rem">The front page of our marketing site</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:.93rem;margin:0">Your house goes on the front page of the marketing website we spend $3,800 a month advertising, a keyword domain built to capture buyers who are searching right now.</p></div><div style="background:var(--ivory-2);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem 1.6rem"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--brass);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.5rem">04</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.55rem">Social media people watch</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:.93rem;margin:0">Our accounts have grossed over 3 million views: high-velocity drone shots, comedy, education that uses your house as the example, and straight listing features. We also send 1,000 flyers to the surrounding homes where the community allows it.</p></div><div style="background:var(--ivory-2);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:12px;padding:1.5rem 1.6rem"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);color:var(--brass);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.5rem">05</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.55rem">The standard work, and more</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:.93rem;margin:0">Everything a good listing agent already does still happens here: pricing, professional photos, MLS and syndication, showings, negotiation, a managed closing, and more, handled by agents with decades of selling experience.</p></div></div><div style="margin-top:1.8rem;text-align:center"><a class="btn btn-brass" href="#seller-cma-form" onclick="document.getElementById('seller-cma-form').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});return false">Get my free home value report</a></div></div></section>
