-<p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--brass-2)">Condo vs. Condotel: What Buyers Can Finance</p>
-<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1);margin-top:.25rem">
