-<div style="padding:.75rem;background:var(--navy-2)"><div style="font-size:.65rem;color:var(--brass-2);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:.3rem">Condotel / Hotel-Condo</div><div style="font-size:.8rem;color:rgba(244,239,232,.7);line-height:1.5">Cash or portfolio loans only: limited buyer pool, pricing must reflect</div></div>
-</div>
-<p style="font-size:.82rem;color:rgba(244,239,232,.55);line-height:1.6;margin-top:.5rem">Understanding your unit's financing eligibility determines your marketing strategy. We review this at the pricing consultation.</p>
-</div>
-</div>
-<div class="persona-panel" id="persona-retiree" style="display:none;background:var(--ivory-2);padding:3rem">
-<div style="max-width:700px">
-<p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:.75rem">Retiree Downsizers and Relocators</p>
-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem">"We're moving closer to family. We need the equity out, cleanly and without drama."</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">You've owned your Grand Strand home for years. You've watched the market run up and cool down. Now you need a clean sale, not a complex negotiation, not a buyer who walks at inspection, and not a closing that drags three months. We plan the sale around your move-out timeline and coordinate with your receiving market agent if needed. We also make sure there is no surprise HOA estoppel fee or condo special assessment at closing. An estoppel is a document from the HOA that lists fees and rules.</p>
-<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:2rem">
-<div style="background:var(--ivory);padding:1.5rem"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:.4rem">Capital Gains Planning</div><div style="font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">SC primary residence exclusion ($250K/$500K) and SC-specific capital gains rules. We prompt you to discuss timing with your CPA before listing.</div></div>
-<div style="background:var(--ivory);padding:1.5rem"><div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:.4rem">Contingent Closing Coordination</div><div style="font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">If your next purchase is contingent on this sale, we build the timeline around that. We don't rush a sale that creates a housing gap, and we don't slow a sale that creates carrying costs.</div></div>
-</div>
-<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Plan My Retirement Sale →</a>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-top:1.25rem">Buying your next home too? <a href="/sell/sell-or-buy-first/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Sell first or buy first</a> shows the three ways to time the two sales.</p>
-</div>
