-<div class="persona-panel" id="persona-inherited" style="display:none;background:var(--ivory-2);padding:3rem">
-<div style="max-width:700px">
-<p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:.75rem">Inherited Property and Probate Sellers</p>
-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem">"We inherited a beach house. None of us live in SC. We just need to sell it."</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem">Inherited property sales are routine. The first step is confirming who has authority to sell, typically the executor or personal representative named in the will, or a court-appointed administrator. We work alongside your probate attorney, handle the contents coordination if needed, and manage all showings and access remotely.</p>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Capital gains on inherited property are generally assessed on the difference between sale price and the stepped-up basis at the date of death, which often results in minimal tax for heirs. We prompt you to verify with your CPA or estate attorney before closing.</p>
-<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Talk Through an Inherited Sale →</a>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-top:1.25rem">Full guide, including probate timing, the tax rules, and a real six-year probate sale: <a href="/sell/inherited-house/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Selling an inherited house in South Carolina</a>. Selling a condo instead? The condo guide is its own page: <a href="/sell/sell-my-condo/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">selling a condo in Myrtle Beach</a>. If you live out of state, read about the <a href="/sell/capital-gains/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">capital gains tax and SC withholding</a> before you price.</p>
-</div>
-</div>
-<div class="persona-panel" id="persona-divorce" style="display:none;background:var(--ivory-2);padding:3rem">
-<div style="max-width:700px">
-<p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:.75rem">Divorce and Life-Event Sellers</p>
-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem">"We need to sell the house. We need it handled professionally and without taking sides."</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem">Divorce sales require discretion, neutrality, and clear written authority. Both spouses on title must sign the listing agreement and the deed at closing. We communicate with both parties in writing, manage the sale on a court-ordered or mutually agreed timeline, and ensure proceeds are escrowed and disbursed per your attorneys' instructions.</p>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">We do not take sides. We do not relay private communications. Our job is to close the transaction cleanly and distribute proceeds as instructed by counsel.</p>
-<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss a Confidential Sale →</a>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-top:1.25rem">Full guide, with the South Carolina rules and each choice in order: <a href="/sell/divorce/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Selling a house during a divorce in South Carolina</a>.</p>
-</div>
-</div>
-<div class="persona-panel" id="persona-investor" style="display:none;background:var(--ivory-2);padding:3rem">
-<div style="max-width:700px">
-<p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:.75rem">Investors and 1031 Exchange Sellers</p>
-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem">"I need to sell this rental, probably do a 1031, and I'm watching the clock."</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem">We understand 1031 exchange mechanics: 45-day identification window, 180-day exchange period, and the consequences of missing either. We price your listing to sell in the window you need, not the window the market average predicts.</p>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">We also run full NOI and cap rate analysis on your property so it's priced and marketed as an investment as well as a residence. Investor buyers want yield data first, list price second. We lead with the numbers.</p>
-<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Discuss My Investment Sale →</a>
-</div>
