-<div class="persona-panel" id="persona-primary" style="display:none;background:var(--ivory-2);padding:3rem">
-<div style="max-width:700px">
-<p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:.75rem">Primary Residence Sellers</p>
-<h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem">"We're local. We want a local agent who knows our neighborhood."</h3>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1rem">You live here. You know what your neighborhood is worth and you'll know quickly if an agent is guessing. We pull the same comps you can pull on Zillow, and then we explain why three of those six sales are not comparable to yours.</p>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Post-NAR settlement, you have real choices about commission. We walk through every option, including what buyer-side concessions make strategic sense in a buyer's market. You get the math and the options, without any pressure.</p>
-<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get a Local CMA →</a>
-<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;margin-top:1.25rem">Before you list: <a href="/sell/repairs-before-selling/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">what to fix and what to leave</a>, <a href="/sell/seller-disclosure/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">what South Carolina makes you disclose</a>, and <a href="/sell/best-time-to-sell/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">the best month to list</a>. Need a fast sale instead? Compare a <a href="/sell/cash-offer/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">cash offer with a listing</a>.</p>
