);margin-bottom:1rem">Island or mainland, we check four things before you offer.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">The flood zone and how high the floor sits. Where the setback line falls on an oceanfront lot. Whether the town lists the house as historic. The tax bill as your main home or a second home.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/?place=Pawleys%20Island">Talk to a Pawleys Island agent</a></div></section></main>
