-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">One seller came to us with a house a rival brokerage could not sell. Our study uncovered that it had been <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">reported flooded years before he ever bought it</strong>, and no one had told him. <a href="/buyers/undisclosed-flooding/" style="color:var(--brass);text-decoration:none">Read the full story, and how to find a home&rsquo;s real flood history</a>.</p>
