-<h3 class="why-c3-title">Communication is our product.</h3>
-<p class="why-c3-body">We made a decision early: the best communication wins. Every client gets a real agent who responds quickly, explains every step, and never leaves you guessing on where your deal stands. No scripts, no runaround, no unanswered calls.</p>
-</div>
-<div class="why-c3-item">
-<div class="why-c3-num">02</div>
-<h3 class="why-c3-title">We publish data most brokerages hide.</h3>
-<p class="why-c3-body">Rent and return calculators. Live vacation-rental income by building. Cap rate analysis. Submarket breakdowns. We put the research tools we use ourselves on our public website: because an informed client makes better decisions and closes with more confidence.</p>
-</div>
-<div class="why-c3-item">
-<div class="why-c3-num">03</div>
-<h3 class="why-c3-title">30+ years of local expertise, backed by technology.</h3>
-<p class="why-c3-body">Broker-in-Charge Tim Nash has 30+ years on the Grand Strand. We pair that with AI-assisted market analysis, current rental-income data, and a digital-first client experience. The two don't cancel each other out: they make each other stronger.</p>
-</div>
-<div class="why-c3-item">
-<div class="why-c3-num">04</div>
-<h3 class="why-c3-title">Every client type. One team.</h3>
-<p class="why-c3-body">From first-time buyers to seasoned short-term-rental investors to out-of-state sellers: we handle the full spectrum. You don't get handed off to a junior agent based on your price. You get the same standard of care regardless of transaction size.</p>
-</div>
-<div class="why-c3-item">
-<div class="why-c3-num">05</div>
-<h3 class="why-c3-title">A lending partner we work with every day.</h3>
-<p class="why-c3-body">Chapter3 Realty has a business relationship with BrickWood Mortgage. A referral can mean faster timelines and coordinated closings. You are never required to use them, and you are free to shop any lender.</p>
-</div>
-<div class="why-c3-item">
-<div class="why-c3-num">06</div>
-<h3 class="why-c3-title">We specialize in the hardest transactions.</h3>
-<p class="why-c3-body">Divorce real estate. <a href="/sell/inherited-house/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Inherited properties</a>. <a href="/invest/strategies/1031-exchange/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">1031 exchanges</a>. Foreclosures. <a href="/invest/condotel-financing/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Condotels</a>. <a href="/buyers/va-loans/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">Military relocations</a>. The transactions most agents avoid, we've built systems around. Complexity doesn't slow us down.</p>
-</div>
