-<section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:3.2rem 1.5rem">
-<p style="font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The honest truth</p>
-<h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Most brokerages are the same. That is the problem.</h2>
-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">Most brokerages are interchangeable, and the quality you get varies from one agent to the next. Too many agents justify their commission by reminding you the seller pays it, instead of earning it by doing more for you. We built Chapter3 to be the opposite. Every one of our agents is trained to do the above-and-beyond work on every deal, without fail, whether you are buying a modest starter home or an oceanfront condo.</p>
-</div></section>
-
-<section style="background:var(--ivory-2)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:3.2rem 1.5rem">
-<p style="font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">After the keys</p>
-<h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">We stay with you after you close</h2>
-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">Many agents stop calling the day you get the keys. We stay. Every month after you buy, you hear from us with the things that matter for your home: <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">historical facts about the property, an updated investor report, real-time alerts when new permits are filed near you, and appreciation reports</strong>. You always know where your equity stands.</p>
-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">We are a young, ambitious team building the brokerage we wanted as buyers, and the tools we wished existed. As we build new ones, you get them. That is how we earn our pay, and it is why our clients are glad they hired Chapter3 instead of a brokerage that stops caring at closing.</p>
-</div></section>
-
-<section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:3.2rem 1.5rem">
-<p style="font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">Formulas vs. facts</p>
-<h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;letter-spacing:-.01em">Zillow gives you a formula. We give you the facts.</h2>
-<p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:1rem">Zillow and the portals run generic formulas, the same national math on every house, with no history of the specific property in front of you. We do <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">actual research on each property</strong>: real local knowledge, the home&rsquo;s real history, and figures built from that exact property instead of an average. On the biggest purchase of your life, a formula and the facts can put you at two different prices.</p>
