}main#main .hx-fb-go{flex:1 1 100%}}@media (min-width:1000px) and (max-width:1100px){.header-ctas .hdr-phone{display:none!important}}main#main>section[style^="background:var(--navy)"]:has(>.wrap>h2){padding:.9rem 0!important}main#main>section[style^="background:var(--navy)"]:has(>.wrap>h2)>.wrap{display:block!important;text-align:center!important;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(42,48,64,.95),rgba(28,32,40,.97))!important;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)!important;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.14),0 26px 60px -30px rgba(28,32,40,.6)!important;border-radius:28px!important;padding:2.2rem 1.6rem!important;margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important}@media (max-width:699px){main#main>section[style^="background:var(--navy)"]:has(>.wrap>h2)>.wrap{padding:1.6rem 1.2rem 1.7rem!important;border-radius:24px!important}}</style></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 12, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Chapter3 Realty pairs an AI home search for the Grand Strand with local agents who check a home for you, and price yours free when you sell.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Tell Chapter3 AI what you want, in your own words, and it builds the search for you. When you ask for more than price and beds, it reads the listing descriptions and puts the best fits first.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Behind it is Tim Nash, our Broker-in-Charge, with over 30 years on the Grand Strand. On a home you want to buy, our team gets the HOA papers, a rental analysis and an insurance quote before you offer. On a home you want to sell, the pricing review is free.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Tell us the home you want. We find it, and we check it for you.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Find me a home</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#ai-search" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Chapter3 AI</a></li><li><a href="#see-homes" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">It reads the listings</a></li><li><a href="#free-numbers" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Free numbers</a></li><li><a href="#people" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The people</a></li><li><a href="#work-with-us" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Working with us</a></li><li><a href="#questions-about-chapter3" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Questions about Chapter3</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="ai-search"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Chapter3 AI">Meet Chapter3 AI: search the Grand Strand the way you talk</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">That search bar above is Chapter3 AI. Type what you want the way you would say it to a friend. "A three-bedroom with a pool in Murrells Inlet under $600,000." "A condo near the beach I can Airbnb." It builds the search for you.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It knows more than 700 things a listing can say, from a dock for the boat to no HOA at all. Tell it why you want something, and it uses that too.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Change your mind halfway? Type "cheaper" or "what about Conway", and it picks up where you left off. It never filters on who a person is or who lives nearby.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="see-homes"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="It reads the listings">It reads every listing, so you do not have to</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Ask for more than price and bedrooms, and Chapter3 AI reads the full description of every home your search found. The best fits move to the top. The ones that do not fit drop off the list. Nobody has to sign up for that.</p><ul class="wc-plain"><li><b><a href="/homes/map/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Photos right on the map</a></b>A click on a dot shows the home's photo and price, and a second click opens it. Click any spot to search around it, in 2D or 3D.</li><li><b>Homes near your daily drive</b>Ask for homes within a few miles of up to two places you go every day, like your office.</li><li><b>Ask about any home</b>On each home's page, sign up free and ask Chapter3 AI about it. Ask what the HOA fee covers, how old the roof and the AC are, what the flood zone is, or whether you can rent it out. It answers from that listing. It can be wrong, and it never gives a value, a rate or a payment.</li><li><b>Homes on the page you are reading</b>Most pages on our site open with a live row of homes for sale and the AI search box. The most appealing homes come first, not the cheapest, each with its photo.</li></ul><div class="hx-strip" data-place="wf-oceanfront-condos" data-name="condos facing the ocean" data-head="Wake up to the ocean: oceanfront condos for sale now"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><style>.c3ph-f{position:relative;margin:0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ivory-2)}.c3ph-f img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:cover}.c3ph-cr{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;max-width:100%;padding:1.6rem .6rem .35rem 2.6rem;font:400 .625rem/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.01em;color:#fff;text-align:right;background:radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 100%,rgba(28,32,40,.72),rgba(28,32,40,.4) 55%,rgba(28,32,40,0));white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;pointer-events:none}.c3ph-cr a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);text-underline-offset:2px;pointer-events:auto;padding:10px 0 6px}.c3ph-hero{margin:1.6rem 0 2rem}.c3ph-hero .c3ph-f{border-radius:8px}.c3ph-hero img{aspect-ratio:4/3}@media (min-width:700px){.c3ph-hero img{aspect-ratio:16/9}}.c3ph-hero figcaption{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5;margin-top:.55rem}</style><figure class="c3ph-hero" style="margin:1.3rem 0 1.5rem;max-width:720px;"><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/2026-11-a/invest-condos/garden-city-condos-2011-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/2026-11-a/invest-condos/garden-city-condos-2011-600w.webp 600w, /images/2026-11-a/invest-condos/garden-city-condos-2011-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 720px" width="1200" height="675" alt="A tall tan condo tower and several low-rise condo buildings with pools on the beach at Garden City, with beach houses and a wide salt marsh behind them" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Photo: USGS. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">Photo: USGS</a></span></div><figcaption>Oceanfront condo buildings at Garden City Beach, with the salt marsh behind them.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="free-numbers"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Free numbers">Run the numbers yourself, free</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Our <a href="/invest/run-the-numbers/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">rental analyzer</a> reads the MLS. Pick a home for sale, and it fills in the beds, baths and size, then estimates the rent, the costs, the cash flow and the return.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It also shows building permits filed nearby. Our other free calculators each answer one question.</p><figure class="wc-card wc-tw"><table class="wc-tab"><caption>Free calculators on this site</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Calculator</th><th scope="col">What it tells you</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/invest/str-tools/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Airbnb calculator</a></th><td>What a nightly rental keeps after the HOA fee, the property tax and Airbnb's cut.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/buyers/cost-to-own/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Cost to own</a></th><td>What a home costs each year besides the loan: tax, insurance, the HOA fee and upkeep.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/buyers/property-taxes/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Property tax</a></th><td>Your Horry County tax bill, as your main home or as a rental.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/buyers/closing-costs/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Closing costs</a></th><td>Both sides of a closing, with real Horry County numbers.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/sell/net-proceeds/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Seller net</a></th><td>What you keep when you sell, line by line.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/sell/capital-gains/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Capital gains</a></th><td>South Carolina's tax and withholding on a home sale.</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="/buyers/relocating/cost-of-living/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Cost of living</a></th><td>How Myrtle Beach compares with where you live now.</td></tr></tbody></table></figure><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Our guides count the county's records</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">We count the county's own records ourselves.</p><ul class="wc-plain"><li><b><a href="/sell/home-value/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Home value guide</a></b>Built from 13,194 home sales recorded at the county's <a href="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/departments/register-of-deeds/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register of Deeds</a>, October 2025 to September 2026.</li><li><b><a href="/invest/condo-buildings/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Condo building guide</a></b>Compare 47 oceanfront buildings in Myrtle Beach and North Myrtle Beach. For most, it shows the monthly HOA fee and what units sold for.</li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Every guide and calculator is on <a href="/guides/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">our guides page</a>.</p><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Send me homes with the numbers to prove it.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Investors ask us for this more than anything else. Tell us your plan, and we send the homes with the numbers on each.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Send me the homes and numbers</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="people"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="The people">The people behind it: three generations on the Grand Strand</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Tim Nash, our Broker-in-Charge, has sold real estate on the Grand Strand for over 30 years. He is the third generation of his family in this market.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem"><a href="https://roads.horrycountysc.gov/projects/fred-nash-boulevard/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fred Nash Boulevard</a>, by Myrtle Beach International Airport, is named for his father, Fred Nash, who sold real estate here before him.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">This is a small town to us. We want to run into you at the grocery store and hear that you are happy here. Tell us what you want, and we will tell you honestly whether it is here.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">We build these tools ourselves, and our team keeps growing, with a focus on using AI to find homes that rent well. We find the home for you; you do not have to bring us one.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">You can <a href="/about/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">meet the team</a> on our About page.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="work-with-us"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Working with us">What you get when you work with us</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Talking with us is free. Consultations, rental analyses and pricing reviews cost nothing, and you pay only under a written agreement you choose to sign.</p><ul class="wc-plain"><li><b>Know the insurance cost first</b>We can get you a quote on the home before you make an offer, so you know what it costs to insure.</li><li><b>Only communities that let you rent</b>When we search for an investor, we leave out communities that ban renting. We read the HOA papers for rules that would block your plan.</li><li><b>The papers behind the home</b>On a home you are serious about, we get the HOA's bylaws and as many of its financial records as we can. We add the building's lawsuit history where it can be found, and a rental analysis.</li><li><b>No old HOA debt at closing</b>Before closing, our agents check whether an HOA lien or unpaid fees will follow the home.</li><li><b>Selling? Two numbers before you choose</b>We show you the price range for a listing and what a cash buyer would pay, side by side. Our <a href="/sell/net-proceeds/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">seller net calculator</a> shows what you keep.</li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">One of our agents sold a rented house for an owner who was moving to New York. The agent offered it to our list of investors, and a cash buyer closed within 13 days of the day he listed. One sale, not a promise.</p><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Thinking of selling?</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Send us the address. An agent sends back both numbers, free, and nobody here pushes you either way.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Get both numbers for my home</a></div><p class="wc-lic">Chapter3 Realty Corp is licensed in South Carolina, company license 28849, with Tim Nash as Broker-in-Charge, license 43182. Both are on the state's <a href="https://verify.llronline.com/LicLookup/Rec/Rec.aspx?div=19" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Licensee Lookup</a>.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="questions-about-chapter3"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">Common questions</p><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3">Questions about Chapter3</h2><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Does Chapter3 have an AI home search?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Yes. Type the home you want as a sentence, and Chapter3 AI turns it into a search from more than 700 MLS features. It answers with one line on what it heard.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Do you have to sign up to use the AI search?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">No. The search, and the AI's read of the listing descriptions, work for every visitor. Asking Chapter3 AI about one home on its page takes a free sign-up.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Does it cost anything to talk with Chapter3?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">No. Consultations, rental analyses and pricing reviews are free, for buyers and sellers. You pay only under a written agreement you choose to sign.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">Is Chapter3 Realty licensed in South Carolina?</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Yes. Chapter3 Realty Corp holds South Carolina real estate company license 28849. Its Broker-in-Charge, Tim Nash, holds license 43182.</p><p style="font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;max-width:760px;margin-top:1.6rem"><strong style="color:var(--navy)">Sources:</strong> <a href="https://chapter3realty.com/homes/map/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chapter3 home search</a>, <a href="https://verify.llronline.com/LicLookup/Rec/Rec.aspx?div=19" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Licensee Lookup</a>, <a href="https://roads.horrycountysc.gov/projects/fred-nash-boulevard/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fred Nash Boulevard</a>, <a href="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/departments/register-of-deeds/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register of Deeds</a>. The 753 features and the share of pages with a row of homes are from our live home search and our sitemap. All were counted on November 12, 2026. Listings are from the CCMLS through our home search.</p><style>.c3ph-credits{margin:2rem 0 1rem;padding:1rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.55;max-width:760px}.c3ph-credits .c3ph-h{font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.8rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);margin:0 0 .4rem}.c3ph-credits [role=listitem]{margin:0 0 .3rem}.c3ph-credits a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgba(28,32,40,.3);text-underline-offset:2px}</style><div class="c3ph-credits"><div class="c3ph-h" id="photo-credits">Photo credits</div><div role="list" aria-labelledby="photo-credits"><div role="listitem">Condo buildings at Garden City Beach. Photo: U.S. Geological Survey, <a href="https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">U.S. Geological Survey</a>.</div><div role="listitem">Chapter3 Realty resized these photos and cropped some of them.</div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-condos/garden-city-condos-2011-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/invest-condos/garden-city-condos-2011-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":675,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"Oceanfront condo buildings at Garden City Beach, with the salt marsh behind them","caption":"Oceanfront condo buildings at Garden City Beach, with the salt marsh behind them.","description":"A tall tan condo tower and several low-rise condo buildings with pools on the beach at Garden City, with beach houses and a wide salt marsh behind them","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"U.S. Geological Survey"},"creditText":"U.S","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (U.S. Geological Survey)","license":"https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/","acquireLicensePage